{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03320","headline":"故赵王属赠黄门侍郎上官公挽词二首 二 · 宋之问","name":"故赵王属赠黄门侍郎上官公挽词二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"绿车随帝子，青琐翊宸机。\n昔枉朝歌骑，今虚夕拜闱。\n柳河凄挽曲，薤露湿灵衣。\n一厝穷泉闭，双鸾遂不飞。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"宋之问","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03320.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03320","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}